--                 • Recency ≤ 90 days  → R_Recent else R_Old
--                 • Frequency ≥ 3      → F_High   else F_Low
--                 • Monetary ≥ R$500   → M_High   else M_Low
--             The output lets us compare how average spend differs across segments.
